{"id":"suave","lemma":"suave","pos":"adj","rank":1575,"glosses":["smooth, soft, fluffy","soft, gentle, light, mild (e.g. mild flavor, a mild winter)","suave (charming, confident and elegant)"],"ipa":"/ˈswabe/","forms":{"femininePlural":"suaves"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-suave.wav","examples":[{"text":"Por favor, sé suave.","en":"Please be gentle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443209"},{"text":"Tom tiene las manos suaves.","en":"Tom has soft hands."},{"text":"Tom cantó de manera suave.","en":"Tom sang softly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800161"},{"text":"Estamos teniendo un invierno suave.","en":"We're having a mild winter.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514846"},{"text":"Su voz era suave y bonita.","en":"Her voice was soft and beautiful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684264"}]}